- [x] Promote shared skills to first-class installable packages (`spec: promote-shared-skills.spec.md`)
- [x] Skill install checksum integrity (SHA-256 digests + install gate) (`spec: skill-install-checksums/step-00-skill-install-checksums.spec.md`)
- [x] Fix skill integrity mismatch (source digests vs `bin/skill-integrity.json`) (`spec: us-90/step-00-us-90.spec.md`)
- [x] check-workflows consumer dependency closure (`spec: us-95/step-00-us-95.spec.md`)
- [x] Immediate UTF-8 stdio reconfiguration (`spec: immediate-utf8-stdio-reconfiguration/step-00-immediate-utf8-stdio-reconfiguration.spec.md`)

